</p><p>
If you would like to pay via paypal, go to <a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/donations/index.html">http://www.pmwatch.org/pmw/donations/</a> and click on the paypal
icon there.
</p><p>
If you would like to be notified of future publications from PMWATCH, please provide contact information below.
</p><p>
If you would like to get a copy of our first booklet, "Countering the spin," please go to: 
<a href="/sites/pmwatch.org/pmw/guide/index.html" class="dead" aria-disabled="true">http://www.pmwatch.org/pmw/guide/</a>
